      "family": "symptom_suppression",
      "expression": "net.prefix_len == 8 and (addr.value & mask_bits(8)) == (net.base & mask_bits(8))",
      "why": "Pins the /8 from the incident to the exclusion of every other allowlisted prefix length, refusing valid /16 and /12 networks."
